WEBVTT

00:12.019 --> 00:14.146
<i>‪When I saw she was playing dumb,</i>

00:14.855 --> 00:16.398
<i>‪I knew that was my chance.</i>

00:17.232 --> 00:20.736
<i>‪Amamiya probably likes her.</i>

00:21.570 --> 00:22.988
<i>‪And the feeling's probably mutual.</i>

00:23.864 --> 00:24.865
<i>‪But…</i>

00:25.949 --> 00:28.869
<i>‪she'll never make the first move.</i>

00:29.619 --> 00:33.123
<i>‪She'll just pile on the excuses</i>
<i>‪and keep pretending not to notice.</i>

00:33.749 --> 00:37.753
<i>‪She's a coward whose sole interest</i>
<i>‪is making sure she doesn't get hurt.</i>

00:38.336 --> 00:40.547
<i>‪She won't do things for herself.</i>

00:40.630 --> 00:43.800
<i>‪She needs other people to make her happy.</i>

00:43.884 --> 00:46.053
<i>‪She's a passive waiter.</i>

00:49.890 --> 00:51.183
<i>‪I hate that.</i>

00:52.601 --> 00:56.980
‪EPISODE 15
‪CLOUDS AND RAIN

00:58.190 --> 01:00.484
‪The Meiten band is having a concert soon.

01:00.567 --> 01:03.361
‪Has Akahoshi or anyone else mentioned it?

01:04.738 --> 01:07.199
<i>‪Now that you mention it,</i>
<i>‪I think I might have heard.</i>

01:07.282 --> 01:08.950
‪Would you like to go with me?

01:09.034 --> 01:11.495
‪My friend is going to be there,
‪so I'd like to go and see it.

01:12.245 --> 01:14.206
‪But I'm too scared to go alone.

01:16.124 --> 01:17.417
<i>‪Sure. Let's go.</i>

01:18.627 --> 01:21.838
<i>‪Let's invite some others</i>
<i>‪who might be interested too.</i>

01:24.341 --> 01:25.967
<i>‪The more the merrier, right?</i>

01:26.802 --> 01:27.928
‪That's true.

01:28.845 --> 01:30.138
‪Oh, sorry.

01:30.222 --> 01:32.224
‪That's all I had to say.

01:32.307 --> 01:35.352
‪I just thought it'd be faster
‪to call you rather than to type it out.

01:36.978 --> 01:38.396
<i>‪Faster, huh?</i>

01:39.105 --> 01:42.275
‪Well, I'll be in touch
‪closer to the date, okay?

01:42.359 --> 01:44.444
<i>‪Sure. Thanks.</i>

01:46.947 --> 01:48.782
‪LIFT
‪SIDE PLANK

01:55.789 --> 01:58.125
‪It won't stop raining.

01:59.626 --> 02:02.045
‪MEITEN HIGH SCHOOL

02:04.923 --> 02:05.924
<i>‪I like you.</i>

02:08.218 --> 02:13.014
<i>‪How should I act around Yota</i>
<i>‪when I see him in class today?</i>

02:13.765 --> 02:16.059
<i>‪Would it be callous of me</i>
<i>‪to just talk like normal?</i>

02:16.768 --> 02:18.562
<i>‪But it'd hurt more</i>
<i>‪to just avoid him, right?</i>

02:19.646 --> 02:22.732
<i>‪Wait, I can't even</i>
<i>‪reciprocate his feelings.</i>

02:22.816 --> 02:25.152
<i>‪Aren't I being lordly</i>
<i>‪by thinking of these things?</i>

02:25.861 --> 02:26.862
<i>‪What do I do?</i>

02:28.405 --> 02:29.406
‪Miki.

02:31.408 --> 02:32.409
‪Good morning.

02:34.286 --> 02:37.289
‪Did you study for today's language quiz?

02:38.874 --> 02:39.875
‪WHAT!!!

02:39.958 --> 02:41.418
‪That was today? Oh, crap!

02:42.961 --> 02:45.255
‪There's still time. You'll be fine.

02:45.338 --> 02:46.882
‪Just memorize the handout.

02:46.965 --> 02:48.675
‪There you go again.

02:48.758 --> 02:51.636
‪"Just memorize," he says.
‪You say it like it's that easy!

02:52.345 --> 02:53.430
‪Geez!

02:54.180 --> 02:56.433
‪Good luck. You've got this.

02:56.516 --> 02:59.644
‪Yota. We're going now.

02:59.728 --> 03:00.729
‪Oh, wait.

03:02.314 --> 03:04.065
‪All right. I'll see you later.

03:18.330 --> 03:20.248
‪He's too kind…

03:27.547 --> 03:28.548
‪BANANA JUICE

03:28.632 --> 03:31.134
‪All right, Miki.
‪Something happened, didn't it?

03:32.636 --> 03:33.678
‪Nothing happened.

03:34.387 --> 03:35.388
‪Here. Drink this.

03:38.058 --> 03:39.059
‪AGGRESSIVE SIP

03:42.437 --> 03:43.688
‪Hey, Minato…

03:45.065 --> 03:48.109
‪You readily go out with people
‪even when you don't like them, don't you?

03:48.735 --> 03:50.737
‪Huh? Wait, was that a diss?

03:51.529 --> 03:54.699
‪Have you ever turned someone down
‪after they tell you how they feel?

03:58.328 --> 03:59.996
‪I guess not.

04:00.080 --> 04:01.248
‪Why not?

04:01.873 --> 04:03.750
‪There may be no reason to date them,

04:04.417 --> 04:06.670
‪but there's also
‪no reason to not date them.

04:06.753 --> 04:07.921
‪I never hated any of them.

04:09.256 --> 04:10.257
‪What about after?

04:11.007 --> 04:13.510
‪Do you ever wish
‪you hadn't gone out with them?

04:14.719 --> 04:16.012
‪I think…

04:16.888 --> 04:18.765
‪they're the ones
‪who regret going out with me.

04:19.432 --> 04:21.017
‪I'm the one who always gets dumped.

04:21.101 --> 04:24.437
‪I figured if they don't need me anymore,

04:24.521 --> 04:27.023
‪there's not much I can do about that.

04:28.483 --> 04:31.027
‪I wonder if it hurt for those girls

04:31.111 --> 04:34.072
‪that you didn't feel
‪the same way toward them.

04:36.032 --> 04:37.284
‪UM, AM I BEING ATTACKED?

04:37.367 --> 04:38.785
‪FEELING GUILTY

04:40.620 --> 04:43.623
<i>‪I hope one day,</i>
<i>‪you fall in love with someone</i>

04:44.249 --> 04:46.376
<i>‪who doesn't care about you at all.</i>

04:46.459 --> 04:48.295
<i>‪I hope she tramples all over your heart.</i>

04:48.378 --> 04:49.379
‪SMILE

04:50.797 --> 04:52.340
‪Yeah. Probably.

04:53.508 --> 04:55.885
<i>‪Unrequited love hurts.</i>

04:56.511 --> 04:57.554
<i>‪I know that now.</i>

04:58.513 --> 05:00.390
‪You're right, Miki.

05:01.182 --> 05:04.644
‪I probably did do something bad
‪to the girls I've dated so far.

05:05.353 --> 05:07.314
‪So it does end up that way, huh?

05:07.939 --> 05:09.399
‪It doesn't work out.

05:09.482 --> 05:11.860
‪Hey, wait.

05:11.943 --> 05:16.156
‪Did somebody try and ask you out

05:16.239 --> 05:18.408
‪and you're wondering
‪whether to turn them down?

05:20.493 --> 05:22.037
<i>‪Crap.</i>

05:22.120 --> 05:24.080
<i>‪Now I've really put my foot in it.</i>

05:24.164 --> 05:25.165
‪No.

05:26.666 --> 05:27.917
‪I already turned them down.

05:31.463 --> 05:32.464
‪What?

05:33.965 --> 05:36.426
‪So it's all over now.

05:38.845 --> 05:42.307
‪I mean, I already knew
‪nothing would ever come of it.

05:43.016 --> 05:46.644
‪But I do feel better
‪after getting it off my chest.

05:47.562 --> 05:49.647
‪Yeah? Really?

05:50.315 --> 05:51.316
‪Yeah.

05:52.734 --> 05:56.905
‪But at the same time,
‪I'm like, "Wow, it's really over."

05:57.614 --> 06:00.283
‪It's been this huge thing
‪inside of me all this time,

06:00.366 --> 06:02.702
‪and now there's just
‪this big, gaping hole left.

06:04.579 --> 06:05.747
‪I kinda…

06:06.539 --> 06:09.417
‪want to hurry up and fill it.

06:10.210 --> 06:11.669
‪Yota.

06:11.753 --> 06:13.004
<i>‪It's okay to--</i>

06:15.131 --> 06:17.717
<i>‪Oh, he's not crying.</i>

06:18.384 --> 06:22.180
‪Sorry, I thought you might
‪want a handkerchief.

06:23.681 --> 06:25.308
‪Thanks. I'm fine.

06:26.101 --> 06:28.311
‪Do people normally cry
‪at times like these?

06:29.145 --> 06:31.314
‪I sort of can't cry, you see?

06:31.940 --> 06:37.320
<i>‪I did feel sad at graduation,</i>
<i>‪and when we lost the final game,</i>

06:37.946 --> 06:42.784
‪but maybe I've just given up on all that,
‪because that's just how it goes.

06:43.952 --> 06:46.955
<i>‪My feelings always escape through tears,</i>

06:48.164 --> 06:50.208
<i>‪but Yota bottles his up.</i>

06:51.376 --> 06:54.712
‪I like this person,

06:54.796 --> 06:56.548
‪but only as a friend.

06:57.924 --> 07:00.426
‪You don't see them as a romantic partner?

07:02.679 --> 07:06.724
‪I did date a few people
‪back in middle school.

07:07.308 --> 07:11.187
‪They'd give me their details,

07:11.271 --> 07:13.606
‪and the vibes were totally there.

07:13.690 --> 07:14.691
‪HUH? ME?
‪WHO?

07:14.774 --> 07:17.610
<i>‪It was like, I could definitely</i>
<i>‪see us as romantic partners.</i>

07:17.694 --> 07:18.695
‪HE SEEMS LIKE A NICE GUY

07:18.778 --> 07:22.740
<i>‪I'd go out with them,</i>
<i>‪thinking I might like them back, but…</i>

07:22.824 --> 07:23.825
‪DUMPED AGAIN!!!

07:23.908 --> 07:25.410
<i>‪But it never worked out.</i>

07:25.493 --> 07:28.621
<i>‪Each and every single time,</i>
<i>‪I felt like I was being rejected.</i>

07:29.205 --> 07:34.294
<i>‪But then again, it's not like I was ever</i>
<i>‪serious about them either, so…</i>

07:34.377 --> 07:35.378
‪HMPH, FINE
‪FORGET YOU

07:36.087 --> 07:39.215
‪So I've never
‪actually been in love before.

07:41.050 --> 07:43.344
‪I was always just happy
‪to have somebody who likes me.

07:43.428 --> 07:47.599
‪So to go out with someone
‪while I'm not feeling it yet, I…

07:48.266 --> 07:50.935
‪I'd basically just be
‪stringing him along, right?

07:51.936 --> 07:56.483
‪I… I'd hate myself for that.

07:57.859 --> 07:58.860
‪So…

07:59.527 --> 08:01.362
‪I think this is… the right decision.

08:02.989 --> 08:04.115
‪And yet…

08:04.866 --> 08:06.618
‪it hurts so much.

08:11.456 --> 08:15.627
‪Do you wish Yota had always
‪only ever treated you as a friend?

08:19.214 --> 08:20.215
‪Wait!

08:20.298 --> 08:22.175
‪-How'd you know?
‪-It's clearly Yota, right?

08:22.258 --> 08:23.927
‪It's obvious.

08:25.011 --> 08:27.180
‪So I…

08:27.889 --> 08:30.225
‪So I'm the only one who never knew.

08:31.226 --> 08:35.605
‪When I said "I love you"
‪and "I'm so glad we're friends," I…

08:37.357 --> 08:38.608
‪I'm so stupid… So heartless…

08:39.776 --> 08:41.277
‪I hate that about myself.

08:46.115 --> 08:47.283
‪What do I do?

08:48.326 --> 08:49.619
‪This hurts so much.

08:51.579 --> 08:55.708
‪You haven't done anything wrong, Miki.
‪It's not Yota's or anyone's fault.

08:56.793 --> 09:00.588
‪Imagine finding out someone
‪who you thought was a friend

09:00.672 --> 09:02.382
‪actually liked you as something more?

09:03.007 --> 09:05.426
‪To think they see you differently…

09:05.969 --> 09:08.179
‪I'd feel a bit disgusted.
‪Wouldn't you agree?

09:08.263 --> 09:09.222
‪CRACK

09:09.806 --> 09:11.558
‪When you fall in love with someone,

09:11.641 --> 09:13.893
‪it just happens,
‪whether you realize it or not.

09:14.602 --> 09:18.106
‪Even if the other person
‪doesn't reciprocate.

09:18.189 --> 09:19.190
<i>‪But what's more…</i>

09:19.274 --> 09:25.196
<i>‪Koyun did say she'd never see her friends</i>
<i>‪as potential love interests.</i>

09:27.782 --> 09:30.577
‪You know you're faced
‪with potentially getting hurt.

09:31.995 --> 09:35.540
<i>‪Who am I trying to convince here?</i>

09:36.958 --> 09:37.959
<i>‪I…</i>

09:39.210 --> 09:40.837
<i>‪These feelings of mine…</i>

09:43.798 --> 09:46.050
‪Man, I'm starved.

09:46.134 --> 09:47.218
‪There you are!

09:47.302 --> 09:48.428
‪Hello there.

09:48.511 --> 09:49.512
‪PEOPLE WHO FORMED GROUPS
‪DURING THE CHEER SQUAD

09:49.596 --> 09:50.722
‪Oh, Kuriki.

09:51.389 --> 09:54.309
‪I'm going to the upcoming concert.
‪I'm really excited for it.

09:54.392 --> 09:55.602
‪Oh, you are?

09:56.227 --> 09:58.521
‪Yep! With Amamiya.

09:59.314 --> 10:00.523
‪WELL, WELL…

10:00.607 --> 10:02.775
‪Are you two… a thing?

10:03.318 --> 10:04.652
‪It's not that.

10:04.736 --> 10:07.280
‪We were thinking of inviting
‪other people as well.

10:07.989 --> 10:11.326
‪Although I'll bet he's just dodging
‪because I'm coming on so strong.

10:11.409 --> 10:12.910
‪TEEHEE!
‪DODGING?

10:12.994 --> 10:14.120
‪See you!

10:17.040 --> 10:20.084
‪Amamiya dodging?
‪Think it's in her head?

10:20.168 --> 10:21.461
‪Must be.

10:21.544 --> 10:24.297
‪Either way,
‪I fear she's gonna end up in tears.

10:26.716 --> 10:28.384
‪GRADE 2 CLASS 2

10:28.885 --> 10:29.886
‪Miki.

10:30.595 --> 10:31.929
‪Are you working today?

10:32.013 --> 10:33.431
‪Hmm? No.

10:34.265 --> 10:36.559
‪Can we… talk somewhere after?

10:36.643 --> 10:37.644
‪Sure.

10:38.645 --> 10:40.688
<i>‪Don't often get invited by Koyun.</i>

10:41.731 --> 10:43.566
<i>‪There's all sorts I want to ask her.</i>

10:43.650 --> 10:45.276
‪YOU OKAY?
‪ANYTHING YOU WANT TO TALK ABOUT?

10:45.360 --> 10:46.819
<i>‪But I also haven't told her a lot.</i>

10:46.903 --> 10:48.154
‪ABOUT YOTA
‪ABOUT AMAMIYA

10:48.696 --> 10:50.198
<i>‪And about Amamiya…</i>

10:50.281 --> 10:51.282
‪IT'S EMBARRASSING

10:51.366 --> 10:53.660
<i>‪But it's embarrassing</i>
<i>‪to bring it up after all this time.</i>

10:53.743 --> 10:54.744
‪I WANT TO GET IT OFF MY CHEST

10:54.827 --> 10:56.829
<i>‪I've never even acknowledged it myself.</i>

10:56.913 --> 10:57.914
‪WHAT IF I MAKE HER FEEL AWKWARD?

10:58.456 --> 11:02.085
<i>‪All these thoughts</i>
<i>‪swirling around inside my head.</i>

11:02.168 --> 11:03.836
<i>‪I'm scared of how it will all come out.</i>

11:03.920 --> 11:06.923
<i>‪Is this a serious talk?</i>

11:07.006 --> 11:09.008
<i>‪Does she need advice? What do I do?</i>

11:09.092 --> 11:11.386
<i>‪Actually, about Yota, I…</i>

11:11.469 --> 11:14.430
<i>‪What do I do, and how much</i>
<i>‪do I say if that's what this is about?</i>

11:17.183 --> 11:18.184
‪Yota?

11:18.893 --> 11:21.437
‪Wanna grab food on the way home?

11:24.524 --> 11:27.527
‪Sure. You can lay it all on me.

11:28.945 --> 11:31.572
‪I didn't mean it like that.

11:35.159 --> 11:36.160
‪SOGGY

11:36.244 --> 11:37.703
‪Hey, these are the best ones.

11:37.787 --> 11:38.830
‪Miki.

11:39.664 --> 11:43.835
‪Listen, there's something
‪I need to tell you.

11:45.962 --> 11:47.713
‪I…

11:47.797 --> 11:49.715
‪-Amamiya--
‪-It's been forever, huh?

11:50.550 --> 11:53.469
‪Feels like you always
‪turn me down for these things, Yota.

11:54.303 --> 11:55.847
‪That's not true.

11:56.556 --> 11:58.307
‪What? Is that you-know-who next to us?

11:58.850 --> 12:00.852
‪No, there's no question about it.

12:00.935 --> 12:03.354
‪You sure about that? Well, okay.

12:04.147 --> 12:05.231
<i>‪-Yota!</i>
<i>‪-Amamiya!</i>

12:05.314 --> 12:07.650
‪So, Minato.

12:07.733 --> 12:08.734
‪Yeah?

12:09.402 --> 12:11.362
‪Are you going out with Kurita?

12:16.242 --> 12:17.368
‪So, Minato.

12:19.328 --> 12:21.414
‪Are you going out with Kurita?

12:22.331 --> 12:23.541
<i>‪Kurita?</i>

12:23.624 --> 12:25.042
<i>‪-Who's that?</i>
<i>‪-Who's that?</i>

12:25.793 --> 12:27.003
‪You mean Kuriki?

12:27.670 --> 12:30.715
‪Yeah, the girl in first year.

12:31.466 --> 12:34.051
‪Why are you asking about her?

12:34.135 --> 12:36.387
‪Because you two are going
‪to a concert together.

12:37.180 --> 12:38.806
‪It's only a concert.

12:39.432 --> 12:41.726
‪I was going to invite
‪some others along as well.

12:41.809 --> 12:42.810
‪Wanna come?

12:43.769 --> 12:45.021
‪Listen.

12:45.104 --> 12:47.356
‪Ever since middle school,

12:47.440 --> 12:49.734
‪you've always been
‪too "friendly" with the girls.

12:49.817 --> 12:51.903
‪You know it gets their hopes up.

12:52.403 --> 12:55.114
‪Should we be listening in on this?

12:55.198 --> 12:57.158
‪But we can't exactly pull out now.

12:57.825 --> 13:01.579
‪How many times have you dated
‪and broken up because of it now?

13:03.581 --> 13:08.044
<i>‪I thought Yota had come to me</i>
<i>‪for once to get something off his chest.</i>

13:08.127 --> 13:11.130
<i>‪But now he's attacking me.</i>
<i>‪Just like Miki did…</i>

13:11.756 --> 13:17.929
‪Are you telling me I should outright
‪reject anyone I'm not interested in?

13:18.596 --> 13:22.058
‪Is it really better to reject outright
‪even when there's no hate involved?

13:22.975 --> 13:26.062
‪I'm not saying to reject outright, but…

13:26.145 --> 13:28.606
‪But you shouldn't lead people on.

13:29.690 --> 13:33.194
‪Do you say that because you
‪didn't like it when somebody led you on?

13:33.277 --> 13:34.946
‪This has nothing to do with Miki!

13:41.118 --> 13:42.119
‪I'm sorry.

13:42.203 --> 13:43.329
‪I'm sorry too.

13:44.121 --> 13:45.456
<i>‪I hit him where it hurts…</i>

13:46.082 --> 13:47.083
‪WELLING UP

13:47.166 --> 13:48.459
<i>‪Yota…</i>

13:48.543 --> 13:51.754
<i>‪Crap… I still haven't</i>
<i>‪told Koyun about this…</i>

13:52.296 --> 13:54.757
‪How much do you know?

13:55.341 --> 13:57.134
‪I'm sorry. I know everything.

13:59.595 --> 14:01.889
‪Sorry for putting you in a tough spot.

14:01.973 --> 14:03.849
‪No, it's fine.

14:04.475 --> 14:05.810
‪Minato.

14:07.436 --> 14:08.938
‪Have you ever been in love?

14:09.814 --> 14:11.482
‪Love?

14:12.066 --> 14:16.487
‪Yeah. As in, no one can replace them,
‪or you feel they're the only one for you.

14:17.822 --> 14:18.864
‪I…

14:19.490 --> 14:21.242
‪I feel that way about everyone.

14:23.452 --> 14:25.788
‪I feel that way about you,
‪and I feel that way about Miki.

14:25.872 --> 14:27.957
‪You're both irreplaceable friends to me.

14:28.666 --> 14:29.750
‪What about Koyun?

14:32.795 --> 14:34.881
‪Koyun's great, isn't she?

14:34.964 --> 14:35.965
‪BA-BUMP BA-BUMP

14:36.048 --> 14:39.385
‪We all hang out together.
‪And you get along with her, right?

14:40.553 --> 14:43.222
‪Do you have any special feelings for her?

14:44.682 --> 14:45.892
‪Koyun…

14:48.019 --> 14:49.020
‪I like her.

14:50.521 --> 14:51.564
‪She's my friend.

14:53.149 --> 14:54.650
‪So I love her.

14:57.445 --> 14:58.654
‪I see.

14:59.447 --> 15:02.909
‪Well, I'd love to see you in love someday.

15:05.202 --> 15:06.287
‪Well, who knows?

15:07.455 --> 15:09.123
‪How am I ever gonna show it to you?

15:14.712 --> 15:16.547
‪I hate the rainy season.
‪It's so humid.

15:18.299 --> 15:19.550
‪Koyun.

15:21.510 --> 15:24.305
‪I'm sorry, Miki. I…

15:25.056 --> 15:26.557
‪I've fallen for him.

15:27.642 --> 15:28.935
‪Yota--

15:29.018 --> 15:30.436
‪I like Amamiya.

15:33.022 --> 15:36.192
‪Wait, what? Hold up. Hold it right there.

15:36.275 --> 15:38.152
‪I'm sorry I couldn't say anything.

15:39.153 --> 15:41.447
‪I wasn't even sure about how I felt.

15:42.198 --> 15:44.825
‪I hadn't even thought about
‪how I wanted things to turn out,

15:44.909 --> 15:45.910
‪so I couldn't tell you.

15:45.993 --> 15:46.994
‪WAIT
‪I CAN'T

15:47.078 --> 15:48.204
<i>‪Wait… I can't do this…</i>

15:48.287 --> 15:51.207
<i>‪So all this time, I…</i>

15:51.290 --> 15:53.751
‪Do not try to wile your way in
‪with Koyun like that.

15:54.460 --> 15:57.254
‪I'd totally ship them.

15:57.338 --> 15:58.339
‪LOSING HER VOCABULARY

15:58.422 --> 16:01.133
<i>‪Crap… I can't…</i>
<i>‪Crap, this sucks, this is all so crappy!</i>

16:02.551 --> 16:03.886
‪I think I'm gonna hurl.

16:06.097 --> 16:07.390
‪Miki…

16:08.099 --> 16:11.435
‪I honestly haven't even thought
‪about how I wanted it to turn out.

16:11.519 --> 16:14.355
‪And he did just say
‪we're "just friends," so…

16:15.356 --> 16:19.026
‪No! By hurl, I meant
‪how I feel toward myself.

16:20.152 --> 16:21.404
‪I always thought

16:22.071 --> 16:23.531
<i>‪it was more like this!</i>

16:25.241 --> 16:26.492
<i>‪But I…</i>

16:27.118 --> 16:30.037
‪But I… Back then, you…

16:30.121 --> 16:33.040
‪But I…

16:34.333 --> 16:36.002
‪ALL MISUNDERSTANDINGS HAVE BEEN CLEARED

16:36.085 --> 16:40.756
‪Does this mean I've been blocking
‪Yota's love life all this time?

16:40.840 --> 16:42.133
‪Definitely not!

16:42.800 --> 16:46.178
‪Either way, I've only ever seen
‪Yota as just a friend.

16:47.221 --> 16:48.305
<i>‪Miki.</i>

16:48.389 --> 16:53.894
<i>‪Remember how you mentioned</i>
<i>‪love being the "cherry on top"?</i>

16:53.978 --> 16:56.605
‪You wouldn't want that to be Yota?

16:58.399 --> 16:59.400
‪Hypothetically,

17:00.151 --> 17:05.031
‪let's say I come out to you and say
‪I've had feelings for you all this time.

17:05.114 --> 17:09.535
‪Could you then turn around and say,
‪"Okay, I now feel the same way about you"?

17:10.327 --> 17:11.412
‪I…

17:11.996 --> 17:15.082
‪I don't think I can do it that easily.

17:16.292 --> 17:19.712
‪I'm more miserable than happy
‪at being asked out.

17:19.795 --> 17:22.006
‪But then I have another side
‪that thinks it'd be easier

17:22.089 --> 17:25.593
‪if I could just fall for the person
‪who's fallen in love with me.

17:26.177 --> 17:29.472
‪I thought I'd only end up hurting him if I
‪said yes while feeling so half-hearted,

17:29.555 --> 17:30.556
‪so I said no.

17:30.639 --> 17:33.184
‪But it still hurts.

17:33.976 --> 17:36.437
‪So what should I have done?

17:38.355 --> 17:39.523
‪Miki. Listen.

17:40.357 --> 17:42.318
‪Yota's feelings for you…

17:43.944 --> 17:45.029
‪are not of a sexual nature.

17:45.529 --> 17:46.947
‪SEXUAL NATURE

17:47.031 --> 17:52.244
‪He doesn't want to be with you
‪for your body or to have sex with you.

17:52.328 --> 17:53.329
‪Koyun!

17:53.412 --> 17:56.874
‪Yota likes you as a friend too.

17:58.000 --> 18:01.629
<i>‪He genuinely sees you for who you are.</i>

18:02.129 --> 18:07.051
<i>‪He's only ever thinking of ways</i>
<i>‪that he can make you happy.</i>

18:07.760 --> 18:10.387
‪He's not out for you to make him happy.

18:11.055 --> 18:12.556
‪That's the kind of person he is.

18:13.182 --> 18:14.183
‪So,

18:15.017 --> 18:18.270
‪don't be hard on yourself
‪for whatever happens with him.

18:20.106 --> 18:23.275
‪To me… You're just Miki.

18:28.989 --> 18:30.741
‪Today, I…

18:31.617 --> 18:34.370
‪Yota came over to my seat today,

18:35.121 --> 18:36.789
‪and I couldn't look at him.

18:39.083 --> 18:41.710
‪I'll try to be more normal tomorrow…

18:43.212 --> 18:44.213
‪Okay.

18:48.384 --> 18:50.803
‪CLICKETY-CLACK

18:50.886 --> 18:52.763
‪PUFFY EYES

18:52.847 --> 18:54.974
‪So, what are you gonna do?

18:55.057 --> 18:56.559
‪Huh? What do you mean?

18:56.642 --> 18:59.270
‪Are you going to tell Minato
‪how you feel about him?

18:59.353 --> 19:01.188
‪No. No, I won't.

19:02.398 --> 19:07.444
‪From my perspective, this is the first
‪you've brought this up with me,

19:07.528 --> 19:09.572
‪so I'd like to support you on this.

19:10.990 --> 19:12.324
‪Thanks.

19:12.408 --> 19:15.286
‪But now I know
‪he only sees me as a friend.

19:16.036 --> 19:18.581
‪I'd like to revert my feelings
‪now while I can.

19:19.331 --> 19:22.835
‪And doesn't Amamiya as a friend
‪sound much more fun anyway?

19:23.502 --> 19:27.381
‪It'd probably be too hard for me to win
‪him over with so little dating experience.

19:29.091 --> 19:30.593
‪CAN'T DENY THAT

19:32.386 --> 19:34.346
‪Let's all hang out as friends again.

19:35.931 --> 19:36.932
‪Yeah.

19:42.104 --> 19:46.650
<i>‪Is it really better to reject outright</i>
<i>‪even when there's no hate involved?</i>

19:46.734 --> 19:50.946
<i>‪Amamiya is kind</i>
<i>‪and affectionate toward everyone</i>

19:51.030 --> 19:52.656
<i>‪just as a matter of course.</i>

19:52.740 --> 19:55.117
<i>‪I thought it was meant just for me,</i>

19:55.659 --> 19:57.328
<i>‪and my feelings ran with it.</i>

19:57.411 --> 19:58.412
<i>‪I…</i>

19:59.955 --> 20:02.458
<i>‪I've been so stupid.</i>

20:19.934 --> 20:20.935
<i>‪It's okay.</i>

20:27.191 --> 20:30.236
<i>‪This is still fine.</i>

20:33.113 --> 20:34.448
<i>‪I can forget.</i>

20:35.366 --> 20:38.494
<i>‪It's not like I entered this</i>
<i>‪wanting to be his girlfriend.</i>

20:39.620 --> 20:43.540
<i>‪I even treated him the way I did back when</i>
<i>‪we were first getting to know each other.</i>

20:44.541 --> 20:45.542
‪She's my friend.

20:46.502 --> 20:47.586
‪So I love her.

20:48.754 --> 20:52.800
<i>‪Just hearing him say that</i>
<i>‪is enough for me.</i>

20:53.717 --> 20:58.222
<i>‪In fact, maybe I should even</i>
<i>‪be questioning my feelings for him.</i>

20:59.431 --> 21:02.017
<i>‪I'm the one who usually rejects people.</i>

21:02.101 --> 21:03.352
<i>‪So I…</i>

21:04.645 --> 21:06.563
<i>‪I must have just been feeling lonely.</i>

21:08.232 --> 21:10.818
<i>‪And if that's the case, I'm okay now.</i>

21:11.527 --> 21:14.613
<i>‪If I can be satisfied with things</i>
<i>‪as they are now, I won't feel lonely.</i>

21:16.365 --> 21:17.741
<i>‪These feelings I have,</i>

21:19.118 --> 21:20.577
<i>‪I can force them back to square one.</i>

21:22.579 --> 21:23.706
‪Good morning.

21:25.582 --> 21:26.709
‪Good morning.

21:26.792 --> 21:27.793
‪GRADE 2 CLASS 2

21:27.876 --> 21:30.713
‪What's this? You're in early today, Miki.

21:32.131 --> 21:33.132
‪Minato! Good morning!

21:35.134 --> 21:36.135
‪Good morning, Koyun!

21:36.218 --> 21:37.469
‪Good morning.

21:41.390 --> 21:42.599
‪Good morning, Yota!

21:47.896 --> 21:49.982
‪I love that energy. Good morning.

23:39.299 --> 23:40.843
<i>‪At this rate,</i>

23:40.926 --> 23:42.678
<i>‪these feelings of mine</i>

23:43.762 --> 23:46.807
<i>‪come across as nothing more</i>
<i>‪than a cruel joke.</i>

23:48.100 --> 23:51.812
<i>‪How can she ever fall for me</i>

23:53.272 --> 23:54.648
<i>‪if I keep treating her this way?</i>

23:54.731 --> 23:56.733
‪Subtitle translation by: Rychelle Brittain
